    "created_at": "2021-02-19T20:11:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-19T20:11:35Z",
    "body": "I see, so this is about letting custom element attributes have equal access to a type of semantic rule that built-in element attributes can have. From that perspective, it does make sense to me (although I'm not sure it should cross the shadow root even then).",
